    },
    {
      "id": "claim_61f32270372a47fcb36156cb6402127a",
      "statement": "The federation mirror seam is deliberately read-only and dependency-free: mirror.py issues only GETs through stdlib urllib.request with a 10-second timeout plus json.loads, imports only the local pure-function audit module, and has no persistence of its own — ingest_chain returns the entries for the caller to keep if it wants a durable copy, and the helper is not wired into the daemon anywhere (its only caller is the federation test).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/haap_directory/mirror.py#L1-L22",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:406b0eb8152364a4f78849f97e6ca1017107f42fa9e29a1d88e0247c4b8ceb6c:"
