    {
      "id": "claim_b177bfa31f634bb898215028f40fa45d",
      "statement": "v1 federation is single-directory with no central registry-of-directories: each directory is authoritative for its own index and another instance may ingest and re-serve a chain with an identical head, so two independent mirror operators whose locally verified heads agree prove they saw the same ordered world; multi-directory trust — querying several directories and taking intersections/unions — is entirely a consumer decision, and building a directory-of-directories is an explicit v1 non-goal.",
